(13, 3, 'Microbalance CM 11', 'CM 11', NULL, 'aczet-cm-11', 'Intuitive to operate with solid built construction; 2.1 g capacity; 1 µg readability; large, bright LCD backlit display; internal calibration; easy leveling; USB and RS232 connection; overload protection; application: accurate weighing of microgram samples for pharmaceutical, analytical, and research laboratory use.', 'Precision Aczet CM 11 Microbalances offering 11 g weighing capacity and 1 µg readability with high accuracy for rigorous analytical workflows. Backed by ISO/IEC 17025 certified calibration and Aczet factory warranty.', NULL, 'images/products/cm21.svg', '[\"images/products/cm21.svg\"]', 'docs/aczet-cm-11-datasheet.pdf', 'docs/aczet-cm-11-user-manual.pdf', NULL, 'docs/aczet-cm-11-service-manual.pdf', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-10-06 05:48:40', '2026-10-06 05:48:40'),
