(77, 5, 'Flameproof Balance CY 4102F', 'CY 4102F', NULL, 'aczet-cy-4102f', 'CY-F Series flameproof precision balances are built with a solid, chemical-resistant cast aluminum alloy LM6 body and epoxy polyester powder coating. Offering 4100 g capacity and 0.01 g readability, they feature a bright backlit LCD, external calibration, easy leveling, and push-button operation. With IP66 ingress protection and optional RS232, they are CMFR-certified for Zone 1 and 2, Gas Group IIB, ensuring safe and reliable performance in hazardo:us environments.', 'Precision Aczet CY 4102F Flame-Proof Balances offering 4100 g weighing capacity and 0.01 g readability with high accuracy for rigorous analytical workflows. Backed by ISO/IEC 17025 certified calibration and Aczet factory warranty.', NULL, 'images/products/cy224.svg', '[\"images/products/cy224.svg\"]', 'docs/aczet-cy-4102f-datasheet.pdf', 'docs/aczet-cy-4102f-user-manual.pdf', NULL, 'docs/aczet-cy-4102f-service-manual.pdf', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-10-06 05:48:41', '2026-10-06 05:48:41'),
