(121, 6, 'Density Scales CY 204GT', 'CY 204GT', NULL, 'aczet-cy-204gt', 'Digital density scales offer high-precision measurements with a 610 g capacity and 0.001 g/cm³ resolution. Using Archimedes’ principle, they accurately determine density, purity, and material quality. Designed for labs and industrial use, they feature automatic calculations, guided operation, temperature compensation, and data connectivity via USB or RS-232 for efficiency.', 'Precision Aczet CY 204GT Density Scales offering 220 g weighing capacity and 0.1 mg readability with high accuracy for rigorous analytical workflows. Backed by ISO/IEC 17025 certified calibration and Aczet factory warranty.', NULL, 'images/products/cy224.svg', '[\"images/products/gxz600.svg\"]', 'docs/aczet-cy-204gt-datasheet.pdf', 'docs/aczet-cy-204gt-user-manual.pdf', NULL, 'docs/aczet-cy-204gt-service-manual.pdf', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-10-06 05:48:42', '2026-10-06 05:48:42'),
(122, 6, 'Density Scales CY 613GT', 'CY 613GT', NULL, 'aczet-cy-613gt', 'Digital density scales offer high-precision measurements with a 610 g capacity and 0.001 g/cm³ resolution. Using Archimedes’ principle, they accurately determine density, purity, and material quality. Designed for labs and industrial use, they feature automatic calculations, guided operation, temperature compensation, and data connectivity via USB or RS-232 for efficiency.', 'Precision Aczet CY 613GT Density Scales offering 610 g weighing capacity and 0.001 g readability with high accuracy for rigorous analytical workflows. Backed by ISO/IEC 17025 certified calibration and Aczet factory warranty.', NULL, 'images/products/cy224.svg', '[\"images/products/gxz600.svg\"]', 'docs/aczet-cy-613gt-datasheet.pdf', 'docs/aczet-cy-613gt-user-manual.pdf', NULL, 'docs/aczet-cy-613gt-service-manual.pdf', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-10-06 05:48:42', '2026-10-06 05:48:42');
