(123, 6, 'Density Scales CY 3102GT', 'CY 3102GT', NULL, 'aczet-cy-3102gt', 'Digital density scales offer high-precision measurements with a 610 g capacity and 0.001 g/cm³ resolution. Using Archimedes’ principle, they accurately determine density, purity, and material quality. Designed for labs and industrial use, they feature automatic calculations, guided operation, temperature compensation, and data connectivity via USB or RS-232 for efficiency.', 'Precision Aczet CY 3102GT Density Scales offering 3100 g weighing capacity and 0.01 g readability with high accuracy for rigorous analytical workflows. Backed by ISO/IEC 17025 certified calibration and Aczet factory warranty.', NULL, 'images/products/cy224.svg', '[\"images/products/gxz600.svg\"]', 'docs/aczet-cy-3102gt-datasheet.pdf', 'docs/aczet-cy-3102gt-user-manual.pdf', NULL, 'docs/aczet-cy-3102gt-service-manual.pdf', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-10-06 05:48:42', '2026-10-06 05:48:42'),
(124, 7, 'MB 54', 'MB 54', NULL, 'aczet-mb-54', 'Designed for fast and precise moisture determination, this halogen moisture analyzer offers ultra-high accuracy (0.0001 % MC / 0.1 mg), adjustable 50–175 °C heating profiles, and a large backlit graphical LCD.', 'Precision Aczet MB 54 Moisture Analyzers offering 50 g weighing capacity and 0.1 mg readability with high accuracy for rigorous analytical workflows. Backed by ISO/IEC 17025 certified calibration and Aczet factory warranty.', NULL, 'images/products/mb200.svg', '[\"images/products/mb200.svg\"]', 'docs/aczet-mb-54-datasheet.pdf', 'docs/aczet-mb-54-user-manual.pdf', NULL, 'docs/aczet-mb-54-service-manual.pdf', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-10-06 05:48:42', '2026-10-06 05:48:42'),
(125, 7, 'MB 50', 'MB 50', NULL, 'aczet-mb-50', 'Designed for fast and precise moisture determination, this halogen moisture analyzer offers ultra-high accuracy (0.0001 % MC / 0.1 mg), adjustable 50–175 °C heating profiles, and a large backlit graphical LCD.', 'Precision Aczet MB 50 Moisture Analyzers offering 50 g weighing capacity and 0.001 g readability with high accuracy for rigorous analytical workflows. Backed by ISO/IEC 17025 certified calibration and Aczet factory warranty.', NULL, 'images/products/mb200.svg', '[\"images/products/mb200.svg\"]', 'docs/aczet-mb-50-datasheet.pdf', 'docs/aczet-mb-50-user-manual.pdf', NULL, 'docs/aczet-mb-50-service-manual.pdf', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-10-06 05:48:42', '2026-10-06 05:48:42'),
